#: ../../language/error_codes/E4230.md:1
msgid "E4230"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4230.md:3
msgid "Invalid use of the `#builtin` attribute."
msgstr "`#builtin` 标注的使用无效。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4230.md:5
msgid ""
"`#builtin` is reserved for the standard library's built-in type "
"declarations; it cannot be used to mark a type in an ordinary application"
" or library package as built-in."
msgstr "`#builtin` 仅供标准库的内建类型声明使用，不能用它将普通应用或库包中的类型标记为内建类型。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4230.md:9
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4230.md:11
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"#builtin\n"
"pub(all) struct Counter {\n"
"  value : Int32\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
#: ../../language/error_codes/E4230.md:15
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4230.md:17
msgid ""
"Remove `#builtin` and declare the type normally. To use an existing "
"built-in type, refer to that type directly rather than trying to "
"redeclare it."
msgstr "移除 `#builtin`，按正常方式声明类型。如果需要使用已有的内建类型，请直接引用该类型，不要尝试重新声明它。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4230.md:20
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub(all) struct Counter {\n"
"  value : Int32\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
